  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "At the hotel front desk, guests check in with a friendly receptionist. One guest has a reservation and shows her passport. Another guest uses a pen to sign a form while the receptionist gives the woman a key card. A bell sits on the desk. Another guest asks, “Can I leave my luggage here?” A porter puts a tag on a suitcase and sets it on a cart. Beside the desk, travelers can have water, hot tea, or coffee in a cup. A nearby shelf holds a towel, soap, shampoo, a toothbrush, and toothpaste. A guest asks for a toothbrush, and another receptionist gives one to him.",
    "textZh": "在飯店櫃檯，住客向友善的接待員辦理入住。其中一位住客有訂房，並出示她的護照。另一位住客用筆在表格上簽名，同時接待員把房卡交給那位女士。櫃檯上放著一個服務鈴。另一位住客問：「我可以把行李寄放在這裡嗎？」一位行李員在行李箱上掛上吊牌，並把它放到推車上。在櫃檯旁邊，旅客可以用杯子取用水、熱茶或咖啡。附近的架上放著毛巾、肥皂、洗髮精、牙刷與牙膏。一位住客索取牙刷，另一位接待員拿了一支給他。",
